<title>UK: Copper resilient on LME, zinc ends at new high.</title>
<headline>Copper resilient on LME, zinc ends at new high.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Ends slightly lower, but above low with spreads tightening again.</p>
<p>ZINC - Bounds higher to end at another 6-3/4 year high on continued speculative buying.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Finishes steadier above $1,600.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Claws back above $6,900, ends steady.</p>
<p>LEAD - Finishes off lows. TIN - Closes steady.</p>
</text>
